{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n>"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おつかれさまぁや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はオムライスを作ったよ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お野菜をザクザク切って、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フライパンに入れて、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しいオムライス作った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完成作品わぁ......！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうですかぁ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや頑張ったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハート型にした、ご飯に、ハート型にした卵を乗っけるのは大変やったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マアヤカラノ質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応えてくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、この前のblogで   質問返ししたんよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら全部消えちゃって..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも皆様からのコメントみたら書きたくなった☆☆☆\nだから今から書くねっ！\nQ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは料理上手な男性が好きなん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A うーん！でも出来ると素敵だと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qプリンはどうしたら固まるんかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A そのプリンはどういう作り方をしたのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それによってだから......わかりませんー(涙)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qレポー風にコメントしてみたらどうかね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A いいと思うー！やってみたいー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q四つ葉のクローバー良いことあるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 皆様にも良いことが訪れるよう、\n四つ葉のクローバーをのせたのっ！\nだから良いことが訪れるよっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qあんこ巻きって何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A クレープみたいな生で、あんこを巻いたやつよん！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q何でダンブルじぃじなの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 、これは話すと長くなるのですが、前blogでかいたように、\nかずみんにはダンブルドア先生のように髭がはえてるようです(^-^;"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qまあやちゃんは何かモノマネ出来ますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A うーんとぉ、ウサギの鼻の真似！わら"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qなぁちゃんがパスタを顔で食べてたやつみた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 見たよー！まあやもああやって食べてたー！\n思い出した！\n今は違うよー？わら"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qまあやはバナナマン以外で好きな芸人さんとかいる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 乃木どこに出てくださった人がすきかなぁ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q渋谷deepA かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A それってどこですかぁ？教えて下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q三雲ちゃんのこと雲ちゃんってよんでんの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A そうです！\nうひゃひゃ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"QまーやS A W シリーズ見たことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aないー！どんなのー？？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 毎週お好み焼き食べるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 毎週も食べないけどよく食べる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qまあやからみればノギメンハいいお姉さんイッパイかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A はい！そうです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 今日もスマイルしてるべか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A してまふよー！スマイルしてるべか？←真似したっ！わら"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q最近みた夢は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aファンのかたが、なーちゃんに告白しようとしているのを、アタシガ全力で応援する夢を見ました。 つまらない夢でスミマセン！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q  ハロー！大好き！は手書き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 違いますー！\n普通のデコレーションです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 火曜深夜にやってるよ！テベコンひーろー！\n知ってる？\n好きな漫画は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 知ってるよん！みるもん！\n漫画は、スイッチガールとかかなぁ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わら\nおにぃちゃんの影響で、ナルトもすきです！えへへ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q ウサギは餌ではなにがすき？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A ウサギの餌とかってよりも、\nニンジンは猛烈にたべます！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！！！以上！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ全部出はないですが、全部おいつけるよう\nがんばりまあやー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/27/9839035/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye ＼(^o^)／"}],"source":"archive"}